      "content": "the doctor's office is closed for the weekend and the nurse line is just going to tell me to go to the er anyway which i really want to avoid. he's still just kinda groggy, but he's breathing fine and he isn't complaining of any pain other than the headache. it really just feels like a bad flu relapse. if i just give him a double dose of the acetaminophen and some ibuprofen to see if we can break the fever tonight, that should be fine right? he's a big guy so he can probably handle it.",
